DESCRIPTION

  Decide per-layer INT8/INT4 assignment and which tensors must stay FP16.     
  Recurrent state and gating signals are the prime suspects for precision     
  sensitivity: unlike a KV cache, GDN state is fed back through every step, so
  quantization error accumulates over the sequence rather than staying local. 



NOTES

