  appendix) shows weight streaming is ~95-99% of decode bandwidth, so weight  
  quantization - not kernel work, not state narrowing - is the dominant       
  decode-throughput lever: INT4 weights take the 4B from ~12.5 to ~50 tok/s at
  100GB/s. This is now the highest-value optimization decision in the project,
  and it is where KleidiAI's INT4/i8mm GEMV micro-kernels (109 of them A720-  
  usable) apply directly.                                                     



